[989.066743, "o", "   220\t\t///\r\n   221\t\tunion UIdxs_t {\r\n   222\t\t\tunsigned short *pIndices;\t///< Index array in memory\r\n   223\t\t\tint nDataOffset;\t\t\t///< Offset to index array in file\r\n   224\t\t} uIdxs;\r\n   225\t\r\n   226\t\t///\r\n   227\t\t/// Mesh bind-pose matrices (Animated Meshes only)\r\n   228\t\t///\r\n   229\t\tunion UBind_t {\r\n   230\t\t\tTMdfMatrix4 *pBindMats;\t\t///< Bind matrix array in memory\r\n   231\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t///< will be NULL if no bind information\r\n   232\t\r\n   233\t\t\tint nDataOffset;\t\t\t///< Offset to bind matrix array in file\r\n   234\t\t} uBnd;\r\n   235\t\r\n   236\t\t///\r\n   237\t\t"]
[989.066833, "o", "/// Parent index map (Animated Meshes only)\r\n   238\t\t///\r\n   239\t\tunion UPrnt_t {\t\t// reference to the (optional) hierarchy (parent info)\r\n   240\t\t\tint *pParentInfo;\t\t\t///< Parent index array in memory\r\n   241\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t///< this array is parallel to the joint\r\n   242\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t///< arrays of this mesh. The index values\r\n   243\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t///< correspond to all of the joint arrays:\r\n   244\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t///< pParentInfo[jointIndex] = parentIndex\r\n"]
[989.067029, "o", "   245\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t///< If a joint has no parent, it's\r\n   246\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t///< index value is -1\r\n   247\t\r\n   248\t\t\tint nDataOffset;\t\t\t///< Offset to parent index array in file\r\n   249\t\t} uPrnt;\r\n   250\t\r\n   251\t\t///\r\n   252\t\t/// Mesh Type used by TMdfMesh::meshType value\r\n   253\t\t///\r\n   254\t\tenum MeshType {\r\n   255\t\t\tMESH_STATIC = 0,\t/// Static meshes use TMdfVertSta vertices\r\n   256\t\t\tMESH_SKINNED,\t\t/// Skinned meshes use TMdfVertSkn vertices\r\n   257\t\t\tNUM_TYPES\r\n   258\t\t};\r\n   259\t\r\n   260\t\tunsigned int VertexSize() const {\r\n   261\t\t\tswitch(meshType) {\r\n   262\t\t\t\tcase MESH_STATIC:\r\n   263\t\t\t\t\treturn sizeof(TMdfVertSta);\r\n   264\t\t\t\t\tbreak;\r\n   265\t\t\t\tcase MESH_SKINNED:\r\n   266\t\t\t\t\treturn sizeof(TMdfVertSkn);\r\n   267\t\t\t\t\tbreak;\r\n   268\t\r\n   269\t\t\t\tdefault:\r\n   270\t\t\t\t\treturn 0;\r\n   271\t\t\t}\r\n   272\t\t}\r\n   273\t\r\n   274\t};\r\n   275\t\r\n   276\t//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////\r\n   277\t/// \\brief A single joint keyframe\r\n   278\t/// \\author Ivgeni Segal\r\n   279\t/// \\date January 20, 2007\r\n   280\t///\r\n   281\t/// Stores information about a single key-frame of a joint\r\n   282\t///\r\n   283\t/// \\remarks All transformation values are relative to their parent.\r\n   284\t///\t\t\t In other words, if joint A is parent of joint B, B's\r\n"]
[989.067316, "o", "   285\t///\t\t\t transformation values represent the values that take\r\n   286\t///\t\t\t the joint from location/orientation/scale of A to B\r\n   287\t//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////\r\n   288\tstruct TMdfKeyframe\r\n   289\t{\r\n   290\t\tfloat fKeyTime;\t\t\t///< Time of start of this keyframe\r\n   291\t\tFloat3 vecTranslation;\t///< Relative translation at this keyframe\r\n   292\t\tFloat4 qRotation;\t\t///< Relative rotation at this keyframe\r\n   293\t\tFloat3 vecScale;\t\t\t///< Relative joint scale at this keyframe\r\n   294\t};\r\n   295\t\r\n   296\t//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////\r\n   297\t/// \\brief A collection of keyframes for a single joint\r\n   298\t/// \\author Ivgeni Segal\r\n   299\t/// \\date January 20, 2007\r\n   300\t///\r\n"]
